--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Model weights

The released UNMASK checkpoints contain the weights of the FS-VFM ViT-S/16 encoder
(Wang et al., Hugging Face repository Wolowolo/fsfm-3c), which are licensed under
the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International License
(CC BY-NC 4.0), and the weights of Meta's Perception Encoder PE-Core (Apache-2.0).
The UNMASK checkpoints are therefore distributed under CC BY-NC 4.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/) and may be used for
non-commercial purposes only. The MIT License above applies to the source code.
